WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.980
Have you ever wondered about the deepest desire
of SCP-1020, An Important Letter?

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:10.550
Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire
Camera, to snap a picture of SCP-1020 while

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:13.380
it was sitting inactive in its containment
locker.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.889
This was the result:

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:19.779
The photographer's mother, weeping, tied to
a chair, with duct tape over her mouth.

00:00:19.779 --> 00:00:24.230
Note: MTF dispatched to photographer's mother's
home found her unharmed.

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:30.140
The 6 subsequent instances of SCP-1020's letter
were all addressed to the photographer, and

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:35.020
demanded that she perform various acts of
sabotage and assassination in exchange for

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.000
her mother's life.

